WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.400
Happy thanksgiving, sweetheart.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.220
I have to go out
for a bit today.

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:05.080
You take your meds?

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.620
Your mother's death
was a terrible loss

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:10.880
to endure at your age.

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:12.290
I think you're afraid
because the man

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:14.120
who did this was never caught.

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:17.800
And maybe that's why
you don't want to leave.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.110
I'm safe here.

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:20.640
You can't stay in here forever.

00:00:23.622 --> 00:00:26.000
A teenager from
California is still

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.516
missing after a one-week
search has failed to turn

00:00:28.516 --> 00:00:31.470
up any new leads or witnesses.

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:35.630
Hey, where did you get
my birthday present?

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:38.546
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:49.238 --> 00:00:50.470
There's blood on this.

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:53.308
This whole thing is
getting out of hand.

00:00:53.308 --> 00:00:54.254
You're paranoid.

00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:55.680
Don't turn this around on me.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:57.230
All I have is us.

00:00:57.230 --> 00:00:59.350
You think I want to lose you?

00:01:02.190 --> 00:01:04.440
I'm afraid that's all the
time we have for today.

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:07.490
[MUSIC PLAYING]

